Argh,

Marchon-bar-mal-neu... so promising, and then... *sigh*

Game started off well enough.  On Dlvl 4 I found speed boots, and on the
same level, a shop containing *two* pairs of gauntlets of power and a nice
+2 robe (I took one pair of GoP and the robe).  I find a bones level with
nothing special save 4000 zorkmids on Dlvl 5, so rather than continuing
down to sokoban (my usual agenda), I return to Dlvl 2 and go to minetown to
buy some protection.

In minetown, a gang of 3 nymphs (one of each type, in fact!) starts lurking
around the gnomes and dwarves I'm hewing through to get to the temple.  I
start getting worried when the first time one attacks she "charms" me and
I'm stuck wearing nothing and missing my GoP.  Fine, I deek out the other
two and stalk her down.  Then the other 2 systematically relieved me of all
my possessions (including my reacquired armour and gold -- no protection
till they die) with terrifying efficiency.  The one that took my speed
boots and GoP escapes upstairs, and the one that took my 2-handed sword,
among other things (with which I was going to retrieve my possessions from
the blessed thieves) runs around town picking up anything I might use to
arm myself, staying safely out of the way so I can't land more than a
single punch with my bare knuckles.  

I decided to go up for my gauntlets and boots first, so I'd have lower-level
monsters to deal with, picking up any alkyses (alkii?) and daggers to kill
the little wench with, but before I know it, I'm surrounded by panthers and
cockatrices and soldier ants (Oh my!).  I tried engraving and praying and
fleeing the level to recuperate when I could, until my tummy started to
rumble.  Unable to kill anything to eat, I decided that if I could kill the
nymph maybe she had also taken my lembas wafers and food rations, too, and
I'd have 2 problems solved (AC = 10 now... hitting "i" gives me a blank
window).  So I'm engraving like mad, trying to punch to death a meal and I
go weak from hunger when a large dog, a soldier ant, a cockatrice, and a
gnome cut me off from the stairs up!  I pray, hoping to satiate my hunger
pangs, and get enough hit points to scramble around my foes and up the
stairs.  Well, 1/2 ain't bad, but I only had 7 hp left.  I engrave again.

The panther turns to flee!
The cockatrice turns to flee!
The soldier ant turns to flee!
The gnome fires a dart. (Aw crap the little bugger came prepared)
The dart hits you.
You hear the howling of the CwnAwnn.
You write in the dust with your fingers (maybe he was out of darts?)
The gnome fires a dart.
The dart hits you.
You die.
DYWYPI?
(The above transcript was from memory, forgive any mistakes)

So, sorry for the long story, but I'm cheesed and thought maybe you'd get  a
little chuckle out of it.  The real question I have is:  How do you guys,
typically, deal with nymphs that aren't sleeping (I always let sleeping
nymphs lie w/o a 1-shot 90%-sure kill)?  What would you have done in my
situation when confronted by 2 or more of these thieving harlots?

